% Rx_TwoSheetTMA.in -- gate fixture for the forward root pick (surfsub FwdRoot,
% 2026-10-04).  dyson5 stage B's 3k eccentric TMA section at -3 deg / 180 mm on
% the calibrated telecentric Korsch parent (F/1.7462), as Telescope emits it
% (repro of addendum 38: `Telescope.optimize` per-field WFE mm-scale while the
% trace "passed").  M3 is a K=-15.8 hyperboloid whose two sheets are 22 mm
% apart: the legacy |L^2-mpr| root pick put 40 of 1185 rays on the FAR sheet
% (dz = +22.0 mm = 2a), 44 mm of extra path, a 10 mm spot tail, 7.8 mm rms OPD
% at the FP.  M2's far sheet (37 mm in FRONT of the mirror) is crossed by 125
% rays before the real surface -- the must-not-flip half of the rule.
